flowchart LR
  U[Authenticated IT user] --> F[Fred interactive chat]
  F --> G[Current application guidance]
  F --> C{Exact change confirmed?}
  C -- No --> P[Preview target and proposed values]
  P --> U
  C -- Yes --> R{Role and ownership check}
  R -- Denied --> D[Explain permission boundary]
  R -- Allowed --> ZC{Zendesk controls loaded and enabled?}
  ZC -- No --> D
  ZC -- Yes --> Z[Zendesk ticket API]
  R -- Allowed --> A[(Post-Incident Reviews)]
  R -- Allowed --> L[(Weekly logs)]
  R -- Allowed --> TD[(Own team to-dos)]
  R -- Manage Todos capability --> TA[(Any team to-do and reassignment)]
  R -- CIO only --> W[(Weekly status reports)]
  Z --> S[Solved tickets]
  S --> X[Zendesk automation closes later]
  B[Observation-only Fred] --> G
  B -. write tools withheld .-> D
